<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes rated a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Great Lakes Chemical Corp with a buy, saying a dowturn in the company's shares has been &quot;overdone.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 43-3/8.</p>
</text>
